I also need a shirt for everyday wear.
I look at a table with summer clothes.
There I see a cheerful, yellow T-shirt.
It has short sleeves.
The colour is perfect for the warm weather in Berlin.
I want to try the T-shirt on.
I walk to the fitting rooms in the shop.
But the queue there is very long.
It is really much longer than the queue at the till!
I look at the label.
The T-shirt is size M.
That is my usual size.
I am sure that it fits well.
I do not want to wait so long on this beautiful afternoon.
So I do not go into the fitting room.
I take the yellow T-shirt and my new green jacket.
Then I go directly to the till.
